<title>SINGAPORE: Carnaud chief resigns from audit team.</title>
<headline>Carnaud chief resigns from audit team.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CarnaudMetalBox Asia Ltd said on Friday its chairman and chief executive William Henry Voss had resigned from its audit committee in compliance to the stock exchange rulings.</p>
<p>Voss was replaced by Khong Heng Kin, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
